@startuml
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml

actor "Visitante" as Guest
boundary "Frontend" as UI

box "Backend" #f9f9f9
    control "post_controller" as Ctrl <<control>>
    control "post_service" as Serv <<service>>
    collections "post_repository" as Repo <<repository>>
end box

box "Infra" #e8f4f8
    database "PostgreSQL (DB)" as DB
end box

== Fluxo: Visualizar Mapa ==

Guest -> UI++: Acessa mapa

opt Utiliza filtros
    Guest -> UI : Define filtros (params)
end

UI -> Ctrl++: GET /posts/pins?params
Ctrl -> Ctrl++--: Valida entrada (PinsRequestSchema)

alt Parâmetros inválidos ou incompletos
    note right of Ctrl #f8d7da: **raise** ValidationError
end

Ctrl -> Ctrl++--: Aplica valores padrão (params)
Ctrl -> Serv++: get_pins(params)
Serv -> Repo++: get_feed(params, pagination=False)
note right of Repo #fff3cd
Monta consulta dinâmica
utilizando filtros e regras
de visibilidade.
Retorna apenas os dados
necessários para os pins
end note

Repo -> DB++: Obtém Pins (params)
DB --> Repo--: Pins
Repo --> Serv--: Pins
Serv -> Serv++--: Verifica densidade (Pins)

alt Excede limite
    note right of Serv #f8d7da: **raise** DensityLimitError
end

Serv --> Ctrl--: Pins
Ctrl -> Ctrl++--: Aplica PinResponseSchema (Pins)
Ctrl --> UI--: 0..* PinResponse
note right of UI #d4edda: **Status:** 200 OK
UI --> Guest--: Exibe mapa com pins
note right of Guest #fff3cd: **Ponto de extensão:**\nVisualização de Detalhes no Mapa
@enduml